invariant: INV-7
file: srv_quic.c
catches: srv_quic_test
reason: ch_srv_quic_init takes a configuration whose original version
  is 0 or one this build derives no keys for, so the server starts a
  session keyed under a version the client never sent.
  test/srv_quic_version_tests.h requires CH_EINVAL and nothing sent for
  each such version.

--- old
    if (!srv_config_ok(cfg) || !quic_version_derived(cfg->quic_original_version)) {
--- new
    if (!srv_config_ok(cfg)) {
